{"parentUuid":"e4608fef-9de7-488c-9b2f-64f82dfdb8f7","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"18814b70-8b7e-4c43-946c-5c9dac496990","agentId":"a064032b3180b0755","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GAsAnX4zMv57bteh3FdFxX","type":"tool_result","content":"table a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n\n/* ---------- chips ----------\n * Severity is encoded by label *and* colour. A chip that only differs by hue\n * is unreadable to a colour-blind tech under bad light, which is most techs\n * under most light. */\n\n.chip {\n  display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono);\n  font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: var(--radius); white-space: nowrap;\n  border: 1px solid transparent;\n}\n.chip.returned { color: var(--sev-returned); background: var(--sev-returned-bg);\n                 border-color: var(--sev-returned); }\n.chip.chronic  { color: var(--sev-chronic);  background: var(--sev-chronic-bg);\n                 border-color: var(--sev-chronic); }\n.chip.cleared  { color: var(--sev-cleared);  background: var(--sev-cleared-bg); }\n.chip.seen-once, .chip.recurring {\n                 color: var(--sev-once); background: var(--sev-once-bg); }\n.chip.ok       { color: var(--ok); background: var(--ok-bg); }\n.chip.real     { color: var(--ok); background: var(--ok-bg); }\n.chip.simulated{ color: var(--sev-returned); background: var(--sev-returned-bg);\n                 border-color: var(--sev-returned); }\n.chip.unverifiable { color: var(--sev-chronic); background: var(--sev-chronic-bg); }\n.chip.plain    { color: var(--ink-3); background: var(--surface-2); }\n\n---\n220:.livestrip .mono { font-size: 11.5px; }\n267:.mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n315:td .mono, td.mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12.5px;\n807:table.codes-table td.n.mono, table.codes-table td.mono { font-size: 14px; }\n1174:h4.mono { font-size: 16px; }","is_error